# CiNQ design system

The name is `CiNQ`. Not Cinq, not CINQ. Products too: `CiNQ RMS`.

Before any UI work read, in order: `brand/design-system/AGENTS.md`, the
product profile (`project-profile.md` or `brand/design-system/profiles/<product>.md`),
`brand/design-system/spec/DESIGN.md`, `brand/design-system/spec/SURFACES.md`.
Tokens are in `brand/design-system/tokens/tokens.css`. Reference components
are in `brand/design-system/code/react/primitives.tsx` and `primitives.css`.
Task prompts are in `brand/design-system/prompts/`. Ship only after walking
`brand/design-system/spec/PRE-SHIP.md` and writing its report.

## Never

- A colour, radius, shadow, font size or duration literal in a component. Tokens only.
- A second accent. Semantic colours are signals.
- Bone text on vermilion. Text on an accent fill is ink (`--on-accent`).
- `text-accent` for a word. Words use `--accent-text`. Fills, the mark and display numerals use `--accent`.
- Pure black or white as canvas or type.
- Gradients or glass in UI. Glass is for fixed chrome only; the hero shader is the one gradient.
- A medium shadow. Large and soft, or none.
- Two motion libraries on one element. Scroll-linked motion under reduced motion.
- Animating height, width, top or left.
- Title Case, em-dashes, exclamation marks, banned words (leverage, seamless, cutting-edge, world-class, next-gen, revolutionise, empower, unlock, robust, innovative, solution, synergy, delight), or a button that says Submit, OK, Get started, Learn more.
- Invented numbers, names, addresses, logos, testimonials.
- A control without rest, hover, focus-visible, active, disabled, loading (and invalid for fields). A region without empty, loading, error.
- A new button, input, dialog, table or nav when a primitive exists.

## Always

- Sentence case. Buttons say what happens.
- Both modes (dark default, `html.light` opt-in) on every screen.
- One archetype per screen, named in the profile; `data-density` set on its root.
- Focus visible, labels bound, 44px tap targets, state never colour alone, `<dialog>` for overlays.
- Tabular figures in number columns. `Rs 12,500`. `19 Sep 2026`. 24-hour in tools.
- Copy in the content module. Custom CSS in `@layer components`.
- Deviations in the profile's register with a reason and a review date. Hard constraints (DESIGN.md §1) are bugs, not deviations.
- When two options are both allowed, the quieter one.

## Stack defaults

Next.js App Router, Tailwind v4 via `tokens/tailwind-v4.css`, GSAP for
scroll (marketing only), Motion for component state, Phosphor icons at one
weight per surface, `next/font/local` from `brand/fonts/`,
`tokens/theme-init.ts` as the first script in `<head>`.
